        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><u>The Barber Shop</u></strong> — an incremental upgrade management simulator where every snip counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your humble, run-down barbershop is about to get a makeover. Invest your hard-earned coins, upgrade your gear, and transform your small-town shop into a sprawling golden parlor worthy of the finest clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your barbers’ skills, keep your customers happy, and deliver the stylish cuts they demand — all while balancing upgrades, marketing, and rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its charming pixel art and simple yet addictive gameplay loop, <u><strong>The Barber Shop</strong></u> offers  <strong>2+ hours</strong> of satisfying snips and strategic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade chairs, tools, and décor to boost your shop’s comfort and appeal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your barbers for faster, better cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time, money, and customers to keep the business thriving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stations and expand your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill pixel-art visuals with an easy-to-pick-up, hard-to-put-down style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn your tiny shop into the ultimate hair-cutting empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><u>The Barber Shop</u></strong> — an incremental upgrade management simulator where every snip counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your humble, run-down barbershop is about to get a makeover. Invest your hard-earned coins, upgrade your gear, and transform your small-town shop into a sprawling golden parlor worthy of the finest clientele.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your barbers’ skills, keep your customers happy, and deliver the stylish cuts they demand — all while balancing upgrades, marketing, and rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its charming pixel art and simple yet addictive gameplay loop, <u><strong>The Barber Shop</strong></u> offers  <strong>2+ hours</strong> of satisfying snips and strategic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade chairs, tools, and décor to boost your shop’s comfort and appeal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your barbers for faster, better cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your time, money, and customers to keep the business thriving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stations and expand your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill pixel-art visuals with an easy-to-pick-up, hard-to-put-down style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn your tiny shop into the ultimate hair-cutting empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
